DESCRIPTION: This snippet shows how to conditionally apply middleware based on the presence or absence of specific request headers. By using the `has` and `missing` properties within the `matcher` configuration, you can create more granular rules to bypass middleware for certain requests, such as prefetching.

SOURCE: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/docs/01-app/03-api-reference/03-file-conventions/middleware.mdx#_snippet_16

